    "$comment": "German ePA profiles (#1172, step 2 of discussion #1169). Not EEHRxF: validate.py writes their results to the report's national section, which build.py does not read, so /eehrxf never counts them as coverage. Each IG is validated in a run of its own, because each pins other versions of the HL7 Europe and German base packages than the EEHRxF run does. Mapped by what we produce: lab Observation, DiagnosticReport and Bundle to the lab guides, MedicationRequest to the ePA prescription profile. Versions checked on the date and at the URL each IG records.",
